  "categorias": "Economía|Empleo|Noticias|Política",
  "post_content": "<p>El programa Onda Factory, que promueve el Ayuntamiento y gestiona el Centro Europeo de Empresas Innovadoras (CEEI), ha instensificado esta semana la formaci&oacute;n en su tercera edici&oacute;n, ya que ha habido tres sesiones en dos jornadas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/04/IMG_9263.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>La semana ha finalizado este jueves por la tarde con las ponencias a cargo del consultor de empresas Valent&iacute;n Gallart (en la foto, que se ha referido a canales de distribuci&oacute;n, y de Sergio Ayala Climent, sobre ventas. &Eacute;ste &uacute;ltimo ha realizado una intervenci&oacute;n de dos partes, claramente diferenciadas, incluso en la indumentaria (como se puede ver en algunas fotos de la galer&iacute;a de im&aacute;genes).</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/04/IMG_9188.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>El lunes por la tarde, el experto en comunicaci&oacute;n Santiago Gimeno (en esta otra foto), de la consultora Gimeno 111, se refiri&oacute; a promoci&oacute;n y comunicaci&oacute;n el producto.</p>\n<p></p><div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9186.jpg\" alt=\"img_9186\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9187.jpg\" alt=\"img_9187\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9188.jpg\" alt=\"img_9188\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9189.jpg\" alt=\"img_9189\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9190.jpg\" alt=\"img_9190\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9191.jpg\" alt=\"img_9191\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9192.jpg\" alt=\"img_9192\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9263.jpg\" alt=\"img_9263\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9264.jpg\" alt=\"img_9264\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9265.jpg\" alt=\"img_9265\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9266.jpg\" alt=\"img_9266\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9267.jpg\" alt=\"img_9267\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9282.jpg\" alt=\"img_9282\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9283.jpg\" alt=\"img_9283\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9285.jpg\" alt=\"img_9285\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/ondafactorysetmana31marc-4abril/img_9286.jpg\" alt=\"img_9286\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4